<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>B2B 테더 공급 서비스 인포그래픽</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;500;700&display=swap');
        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif;
        }
        /* 화살표 아이콘을 위한 간단한 스타일 */
        .flow-arrow {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2rem;
            line-height: 1;
            color: #d1d5db; /* gray-300 */
            margin: 0.5rem 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 p-4 md:p-10" style="font-family: 'Inter', 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif;">

    <div class="container mx-auto max-w-5xl bg-white shadow-2xl rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
        
        <!-- Header -->
        <header class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-700 to-blue-500 text-white p-8 md:p-12">
            <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-2">홍콩 GRE그룹 & 한국 우리은행</h1>
            <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-light">B2B 테더(USDT) 공급 서비스</p>
        </header>

        <main class="p-6 md:p-10 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

            <!-- Left Column: Key Players & Conditions -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-2 space-y-8">
                
                <!-- Section: Key Players -->
                <section>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-5 border-b-2 border-blue-200 pb-2">주요 기관</h2>
                    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                        <!-- Card 1 -->
                        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-5 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-shadow hover:shadow-lg">
                            <div class="flex items-center mb-3">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-blue-600 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H7a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z" />
                                </svg>
                                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">테더 공급사</h3>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-gray-700">홍콩 GRE 그룹</p>
                        </div>
                        <!-- Card 2 -->
                        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-5 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-shadow hover:shadow-lg">
                            <div class="flex items-center mb-3">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-blue-600 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 9V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-2m0-4h-4m4 0l-4-4m4 4l-4 4" />
                                </svg>
                                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">테더 자금 수령 (HK)</h3>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-gray-700">홍콩 SC은행 (GRE 지점)</p>
                        </div>
                        <!-- Card 3 -->
                        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-5 rounded-lg shadow-md transition-shadow hover:shadow-lg">
                            <div class="flex items-center mb-3">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-blue-600 mr-2" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 9V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-2m0-4h-4m4 0l-4-4m4 4l-4 4" />
                                </svg>
                                <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900">자금 수령 (KR)</h3>
                            </div>
                            <p class="text-gray-700">우리은행 (방배동 지점)</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- Section: Trading Conditions -->
                <section>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-5 border-b-2 border-blue-200 pb-2">USDT 정식 거래 조건</h2>
                    <div class="space-y-4">
                        <!-- Condition 1 -->
                        <div class="flex items-start p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-blue-700 mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-1" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm-1.75-4.5a.75.75 0 001.5 0V8.25a.75.75 0 00-1.5 0V13.5zM10 6a.75.75 0 100-1.5.75.75 0 000 1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                            </svg>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">가격 기준 (김치프리미엄 없음)</h4>
                                <p class="text-gray-700">Google.com USDT 가격 기준 + 수수료 1%</p>
                                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 mt-1">*Google 가격: CoinMarketCap, Coinbase 등 주요 거래소의 VWAP (거래량 가중평균) 기준</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <!-- Condition 2 -->
                        <div class="flex items-start p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-blue-700 mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-1" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm-1.75-4.5a.75.75 0 001.5 0V8.25a.75.75 0 00-1.5 0V13.5zM10 6a.75.75 0 100-1.5.75.75 0 000 1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                            </svg>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">최소 거래 금액</h4>
                                <p class="text-gray-700">기본 1억 USDT (10억 USDT 이상 시 수수료 할인)</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <!-- Condition 3 -->
                        <div class="flex items-start p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-blue-700 mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-1" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm-1.75-4.5a.75.75 0 001.5 0V8.25a.75.75 0 00-1.5 0V13.5zM10 6a.75.75 0 100-1.5.75.75 0 000 1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                            </svg>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">합법성 및 투명성</h4>
                                <p class="text-gray-700">금감위 FIU 승인, 100% 계좌 거래</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <!-- Condition 4 -->
                        <div class="flex items-start p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-lg">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6 text-blue-700 mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-1" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                                <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm-1.75-4.5a.75.75 0 001.5 0V8.25a.75.75 0 00-1.5 0V13.5zM10 6a.75.75 0 100-1.5.75.75 0 000 1.5z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                            </svg>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">거래 안정성</h4>
                                <p class="text-gray-700">실거래 시 우리은행에 자금 이체 필수</p>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>
            </div>

            <!-- Right Column: Procedure -->
            <aside class="lg:col-span-1 bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg shadow-inner">
                
                <!-- Pre-Procedure -->
                <section class="mb-8">
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-5 border-b-2 border-gray-300 pb-2">사전 절차</h2>
                    <ol class="relative border-l border-gray-300">
                        <li class="mb-6 ml-6">
                            <span class="absolute flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 bg-blue-200 rounded-full -left-3 ring-4 ring-white">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 text-blue-700" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                                    <path d="M9 2a1 1 0 00-1 1v1H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h8a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2V3a1 1 0 00-1-1H9z" />
                                </svg>
                            </span>
                            <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">서류 제공</h4>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">바이어 LOI (의향서), CIS (회사정보)</p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="mb-6 ml-6">
                            <span class="absolute flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 bg-blue-200 rounded-full -left-3 ring-4 ring-white">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 text-blue-700" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                                    <path d="M13 6a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0zM18 8a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM14 15a4 4 0 00-8 0v3h8v-3zM6 8a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM16 18v-3a5.972 5.972 0 00-1-3.715A9.954 9.954 0 0110 11.043C7.3 11.043 4.84 12.35 3 14.285V18h13z" />
                                </svg>
                            </span>
                            <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">미팅</h4>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">한국 GRE 대표와 미팅</p>
                        </li>
                        <li class="ml-6">
                            <span class="absolute flex items-center justify-center w-6 h-6 bg-blue-200 rounded-full -left-3 ring-4 ring-white">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-4 w-4 text-blue-700" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor">
                                    <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M4 4a2 2 0 012-2h4.586A2 2 0 0112 2.586L15.414 6A2 2 0 0116 7.414V16a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V4zm2 6a1 1 0 011-1h6a1 1 0 110 2H7a1 1 0 01-1-1zm1 3a1 1 0 100 2h6a1 1 0 100-2H7z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
                                </svg>
                            </span>
                            <h4 class="font-semibold text-gray-900">계약</h4>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">우리은행 담당자 지정</p>
                        </li>
                    </ol>
                </section>
                
                <!-- Main Procedure -->
                <section>
                    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-5 border-b-2 border-gray-300 pb-2">본거래 절차</h2>
                    <div class="space-y-2">
                        <!-- Step 1 -->
                        <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
                            <span class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded-full mb-2">STEP 1</span>
                            <p class="font-semibold text-gray-800">구매자금 예치</p>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">[구매자] -> [우리은행]</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flow-arrow">↓</div>
                        <!-- Step 2 -->
                        <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
                            <span class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded-full mb-2">STEP 2</span>
                            <p class="font-semibold text-gray-800">핸드 셰이크</p>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">[셀러 (HK GRE)] -> [구매자]</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flow-arrow">↓</div>
                        <!-- Step 3 -->
                        <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
                            <span class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded-full mb-2">STEP 3</span>
                            <p class="font-semibold text-gray-800">테더 검증 및 거래 승인</p>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">[구매자] -> [우리은행 담당자]</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flow-arrow">↓</div>
                        <!-- Step 4 -->
                        <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
                            <span class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded-full mb-2">STEP 4</span>
                            <p class="font-semibold text-gray-800">테더 전송</p>
                            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600">[셀러 (HK GRE)] -> [구매자]</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="flow-arrow">↓</div>
                        <!-- Step 5 -->
                        <div class="p-4 bg-green-50 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-green-200">
                            <span class="inline-block bg-green-600 text-white text-xs font-bold px-2 py-1 rounded-full mb-2">FINISH</span>
                            <p class="font-semibold text-green-800">은행간 송금 (거래 완료)</p>
                            <p class="text-sm text-green-700">[우리은행] -> [홍콩 SC은행]</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>

            </aside>
        </main>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
